QUENTIN HARDY: Well that's OK.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.725
VINT CERF: OK.

00:19:32.725 --> 00:19:34.350
MARC ANDREESSEN: So
it is interesting--

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:34.620
QUENTIN HARDY: Done.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.130
VINT CERF: Right.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:36.250
MARC ANDREESSEN: I mean
