00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.010
That would be good
for everyone of you.

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.440
MARC ANDREESSEN:
That would be good.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:08.950
VINT CERF: OK.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.750
QUENTIN HARDY: This is
very much an "if" question

